  "details": "*I noticed that the item rotation with IOPJKL keys will cut off after a certain speed threshold is reached!*\n\nOn desktop, I can't use IOPJKL to grabbed objects while...\n\n-Walking\n\n-Running (holding shift)\n\n-Crouch walking\n\n-Crouch running (holding shift)\n\n-Jumping\n\n-Falling\n\nBut I can still rotate a grabbed object while\n\n-Standing still\n\n-Standing still crouched\n\n-Standing still prone\n\n-Crawling in prone state (by pressing Z).\n\n-Speed crawling (holding shift in prone while moving).",
